# Vercel auto-deploy

This project deploys to Vercel on every push to `main` (repo: `markbailey92/matchat`, production: https://matchat-xi.vercel.app).

After making code changes the user asked for (or that clearly should ship), unless they say otherwise:

1. Stage and commit with a concise message focused on why.
2. Push to `origin main`.
3. Briefly confirm the push — Vercel will build automatically.

Do not commit secrets (`.env.local`, keys). Do not push if the user explicitly asked for local-only work or said not to deploy.

If `git push` fails with wrong GitHub account, run `gh auth setup-git` (logged in as `markbailey92`).
